    <string name="presentazione_webcam_titolo">Your phone becomes the webcam</string>
    <string name="presentazione_webcam_testo">WebcamLR sends your phone\'s camera video to your Mac or PC, for video calls, lessons and live streams. Much sharper than the computer\'s webcam, with almost no delay.</string>
    <string name="presentazione_webcam_scena">A phone on a stand sends video to the computer. In the video call your tile is the big one: drag to compare.</string>
    <string name="presentazione_webcam_valore_telefono">Mostly the phone: sharp and bright.</string>
    <string name="presentazione_webcam_valore_computer">Mostly the computer\'s webcam: grainy and dark.</string>
